@api = http://localhost:8080
@simulator = http://127.0.0.1:9090

### 1. Seed polis aktif (409 jika sudah dibuat; lanjutkan)
POST {{api}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{"policyNumber":"POL-COMPLEX-123456","holderName":"Demo Holder","holderEmail":"holder@example.test","premium":100.00,"status":"ACTIVE"}

### 2. Submit sukses — ganti key untuk pengajuan baru
POST {{api}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-001

{"policyNumber":"POL-COMPLEX-123456","amount":1000.00,"claimantEmail":"claimant@example.test","description":"Synthetic diagnosis: never logged","contentType":"text/plain","documentBase64":"ZGVtby1kb2N1bWVudA=="}

> {% client.global.set("claimId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. Lihat state klaim
GET {{api}}/api/claims/{{claimId}}

### 4. Core menerima lalu menunda respons sampai timeout (rule sekali)
POST {{simulator}}/__demo/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"core.submit","fault":"TIMEOUT_AFTER_ACCEPT"}

### 5. Submit — 202 PENDING_RECONCILIATION; dokumen tidak dihapus
POST {{api}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-timeout-001

{"policyNumber":"POL-COMPLEX-123456","amount":1000.00,"claimantEmail":"claimant@example.test","description":"Synthetic diagnosis: never logged","contentType":"text/plain","documentBase64":"ZGVtby1kb2N1bWVudA=="}

> {% client.global.set("pendingClaimId", response.body.id); %}

### 6. Lookup core tanpa submit ulang — SUBMITTED
POST {{api}}/api/claims/{{pendingClaimId}}/reconcile

### 7. Core menolak sesudah upload
POST {{simulator}}/__demo/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"core.submit","fault":"REJECT"}

### 8. Submit — 422, dokumen dihapus sebagai kompensasi
POST {{api}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-rejected-001

{"policyNumber":"POL-COMPLEX-123456","amount":1000.00,"claimantEmail":"claimant@example.test","description":"Synthetic diagnosis: never logged","contentType":"text/plain","documentBase64":"ZGVtby1kb2N1bWVudA=="}

### 9a. Upload menulis object lalu error
POST {{simulator}}/__demo/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"s3.put","fault":"ERROR_AFTER_WRITE"}

### 9b. Cleanup juga gagal
POST {{simulator}}/__demo/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"s3.delete","fault":"UNAVAILABLE"}

### 10. Submit — 503, state COMPENSATION_REQUIRED tersimpan, kedua error tercatat
POST {{api}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-cleanup-failed-001

{"policyNumber":"POL-COMPLEX-123456","amount":1000.00,"claimantEmail":"claimant@example.test","description":"Synthetic diagnosis: never logged","contentType":"text/plain","documentBase64":"ZGVtby1kb2N1bWVudA=="}

### 11. Notifikasi gagal sekali
POST {{simulator}}/__demo/faults
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"notification.send","fault":"UNAVAILABLE"}

### 12. Submit — klaim tetap SUBMITTED, notification PENDING
POST {{api}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-notification-001

{"policyNumber":"POL-COMPLEX-123456","amount":1000.00,"claimantEmail":"claimant@example.test","description":"Synthetic diagnosis: never logged","contentType":"text/plain","documentBase64":"ZGVtby1kb2N1bWVudA=="}

> {% client.global.set("notificationClaimId", response.body.id); %}

### 13. Retry notifikasi melalui reconcile
POST {{api}}/api/claims/{{notificationClaimId}}/reconcile

### 14. Jumlah side effects dan trace ID yang diterima simulator
GET {{simulator}}/__demo/state
